  "scope": "Add the complete eleven-lane, forty-four-route owned checked-record hosted matrix gate. Require explicit canonical capture-index identities, one shared native/managed producer, independent npm and PHP-Wasm provenance, an exact committed Git file set and streamed byte authentication, and independent replay of every retained archive before emitting a receipt. Document the maintainer command and register rejection and Git-audit tests. Refresh exactly eleven live documentation hashes and preserve every other inventory byte. This prepares verification only: no support cells, prior evidence, archives, runtime implementation or installed-support claims change. The actual complete matrix gate still requires the final npm/browser capture and a successful eleven-lane replay.",
